; Every warning enabled and fatal while developing except warning 48 since 
; [QCheck_alcotest.to_alcotest] carries optional arguments that
; [List.map] erases.
;
; Scoped to the dev profile, so a release build (opam, [dune build -p]) keeps
; dune's defaults and installs even if a future compiler adds a warning.

(env
 (dev
  (flags
   (:standard -w +a-48 -warn-error +a))))
